OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to buy out town centre units
OL,4,Afor regeneration
OL,5,
OL,6,FProperties in a town centre could be
OL,7,Fbought from owners without their
OL,8,Fconsent under plans to redevelop the
OL,9,Farea.
OL,11,FWestmorland and Furness Council is
OL,12,Fexpected to start preparing paperwork
OL,13,Ffor what is known as a compulsory
OL,14,Fpurchase order, to buy properties in
OL,15,FBarrow town centre as part of a
OL,16,Fregeneration programme.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
