OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to buy out town centre units
OL,4,Afor regeneration
OL,5,
OL,6,FA report prepared ahead of Tuesday's
OL,7,Fcabinet meeting, where the proposal
OL,8,Fwill be discussed, said the Liberal
OL,9,FDemocrat authority would look to
OL,10,Fnegotiate any purchase with owners in
OL,11,Fthe first instance.
OL,13,FHowever, the council said several
OL,14,Fparcels it wants to use as part of its
OL,15,Fplans may be difficult to acquire "due
OL,16,Fto absentee landlords" or "unrealistic
OL,17,Fexpectations of land value".
